### Root cause & fixes

1. **App bug (`Untranslated` dropped `data-testid`)**:
   - In [StackedWaferPanel.tsx](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/wafer-map/StackedWaferPanel.tsx#L1093-L1102), the stacked brush coordinate range was rendered inside `<Untranslated data-testid="stacked-selection-coords">`.
   - [I18nProvider.tsx](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/i18n/I18nProvider.tsx#L152-L173) only accepted `children` and `className`, silently discarding `data-testid` (and any other HTML/`data-*`/`aria-*` attributes) when rendering `<bdi translate="no">`.
   - **Fix**: Extended `UntranslatedProps` with `Omit<React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLElement>, 'translate'>` and forwarded `{...rest}` to `<bdi {...rest} translate="no" className={className}>`, plus added a regression assertion in [i18n-provider.test.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/ui/i18n/i18n-provider.test.ts#L251-L268).

2. **Test assumption mismatch (`prefers-reduced-motion` transition duration)**:
   - Once `stacked-selection-coords` was visible, [brushing-t14.spec.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/e2e/brushing-t14.spec.ts#L196-L207) failed expecting `getComputedStyle(el).transitionDuration === '0s'`, whereas [globals.css](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/src/app/globals.css#L977-L986) intentionally sets `transition-duration: 0.01ms !important` (`1e-05s`) under `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` while `ActiveFilterChips` sets `motion-reduce:transition-none` (`transitionProperty === 'none'`).
   - **Fix**: Updated [brushing-t14.spec.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/e2e/brushing-t14.spec.ts#L196-L207) to assert both `transitionProperty === 'none'` and `durationSeconds <= 0.001`, matching [parametric-t13.spec.ts](file:///workspace/projects/90e552d5-724b-49e1-bd52-acbbadbf680c/repos/chip-autopsy-lab/e2e/parametric-t13.spec.ts#L195-L206).

